<title>POLAND: JELFA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.55 vs   2.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.97 vs   3.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.94 vs   3.60</p>
<p> Sales		   12.71 vs  11.68</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.63 vs  15.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	29.28 vs  24.21</p>
<p> Operating profit    27.90 vs  24.48</p>
<p> Sales		  135.33 vs 116.32</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish pharmaceuticals company is Jelfa</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
